abstract: >-
  SimpleITK implementation for the independent recomputation of nine
  three-dimensional CT features (volume, surface area, sphericity, CT
  mean/median/max/min, entropy, and solid-component proportion) from a thin-slice
  CT series and a binary ROI mask.